<title>FRANCE: Rouen May 1-14 flour exports at 11,910 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen May 1-14 flour exports at 11,910 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen reached 11,910 tonnes between May 1 and May 14, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour was destined for Libya, they said.</p>
<p>Flour exports for the whole of May 1996 were 34,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>One ship was expected in port by May 21 to load 6,000 tonnes of flour. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
</text>
